merchant_stage.description:
Onboarding progress: `no_application` not applied yet; `processing` application submitted and under review (merchant not activated yet); `rejected` application rejected (see `rejected_reason`);
`pay_frozen` payment collection frozen; `silent` flagged by the payment provider as a dormant merchant with abnormal operation, cannot collect payments until unfrozen; `approved_no_form` merchant activated but no payment form bound yet;
`has_form_no_income` payment form bound but no successful payment yet; `payout_frozen` can collect payments but payouts are frozen; `receiving` collecting payments normally.
